ukrane claims that this is the moment a  Russian ship was ordered to ram a  Ukrainian naval boat on the Black Sea  the incident happened on Sunday  afternoon shots were also reportedly  fired and Russian Special Forces boarded  the three boats he seized them six  ukrainian sailors are said to have been  injured and the ukrainian President  called an emergency session of his war  cabinet they met late into the night  according to preliminary information six  naval officers were wounded some were  wounded some were traumatized during the  operation on board the vessels two naval  officers were severely injured according  to the information we have our naval  officers were deprived of the  opportunity to communicate and contact  their commanders the Kerch Strait is a  crucial but contested strip of water  Ukraine said it's boats were moving from  one major port Odessa to another  Mariupol and they reportedly gave the  Russian Navy advanced warning but a  Russian tanker was photographed blocking  the Straits parked under a recently  opened bridge that connects Crimea on  one side to the southern Russian  mainland on the other Russian fighter  jets were also scrambled to fly over the  area the Russian Federal Security  Service the FSB said that it has  irrefutable evidence that Kiev prepared  and orchestrated provocation in the  Black Sea these materials will soon be  made public it's Washington and NATO  both said that they were monitoring the  situation Kiev said it would seek  diplomatic and legal response and  involved the UN Security Council for now  tensions have subsided but it was a  violent incident between two enemies in  a volatile region and there will almost  certainly be fallout Alistair bundle Sky  News
 

